:: Alex Gifts List
<<effects>>
<<npc "Alex">>

What would you like to give Alex?
<br><br>
<<food_gift_list>>

<<if _food_gift_found is true>>
	<<skinicon "give">><<link [[Give gift (0:05)|Alex Gifts]]>><<endevent>><<pass 5>><<give_gift Alex>><</link>>
	<br>
<</if>>
<<refuseicon>><<link [[Reconsider|Alex Gifts Reconsider]]>><</link>>
<br>

:: Alex Gifts Reconsider
<<effects>>

Alex smiles at you.
<br><br>

<<link [[Next|Farm Alex Bedroom]]>><<endevent>><</link>>
<br>

:: Alex Gifts
<<effects>>
<<npc Alex>><<person1>>
<<set _gift to setup.foodstuff[$gift].name + (setup.foodstuff[$gift].food.handheld_gift ? " gift" : "")>>
<<wearProp _gift>>

<<if $phase is 1>>
	"I've brought you something," you say.
<<elseif $phase is 2>>
	"I made something," you say. "Just for you."
<<else>>
	"I've made you a gift," you say. "I hope you like it."
<</if>>
<br><br>

<<if $gift is "full_english_breakfast">>
	Alex grins. "It's never the wrong time of day for such a breakfast," <<he>> says, grabbing a handy knife and fork from a drawer. <<He>> tucks in at once, pausing only to wipe grease from <<his>> chin.<<gglove>><<npcincr Alex love 3>>
	<br><br>

	<<link [["Tell " + $NPCList[0].pronouns.him + " to eat more gracefully"|Alex Gifts Breakfast Tell]]>><<npcincr Alex dom -1>><</link>><<ldom>>
	<br>
	<<link [[Just watch|Alex Gifts Breakfast Watch]]>><</link>>
	<br>
	<<saveFavoriteFood "Alex" $gift>>
	<<earnFeat "Home Cooking">>
<<elseif $gift is "apple_crumble">>
	"Apple crumble!" Alex says as you place the dessert in front of <<him>>. "My favourite!" <<He>> tucks in, shovelling large spoonfuls into <<his>> mouth in one go.
	<br><br>
	"The fruit has just the right amount of tartness," <<he>> says with <<his>> mouth full. "You're a good cook."<<gglove>><<npcincr Alex love 3>>
	<br><br>
	<<link [[Thank|Alex Gifts Crumble Thank]]>><</link>>
	<br>
	<<link [[Compliment|Alex Gifts Crumble Compliment]]>><<npcincr Alex dom 1>><</link>><<gdom>>
	<br>
	<<saveFavoriteFood "Alex" $gift>>
	<<earnFeat "Home Cooking">>
<<elseif $gift is "steak">>
	<<if !$per_npc.alexs_parent2>>
		<<generate2>>
		<<saveNPC 1 "alexs_parent2">>
	<<else>>
		<<loadNPC 1 "alexs_parent2">>
	<</if>>
	"This looks fancy," Alex says, observing the steak in front of <<him>>. "Like something prepared in a restaurant." <<He>> slices part of the meat, and seems surprised by its tenderness.
	<br><br>
	"Wow," <<he>> says through a mouthful. "My <<person2>><<ma>> would love this."<<gglove>><<npcincr Alex love 3>>
	<br><br>
	<<person1>><<He>> eats a bit too fast. You're worried <<hes>> going to choke.
	<br><br>

	<<link [[Get some water|Alex Gifts Steak Water]]>><<npcincr Alex love 1>><</link>><<glove>>
	<br>
	<<link [[Just wait|Alex Gifts Steak Wait]]>><</link>>
	<br>
	<<saveFavoriteFood "Alex" $gift>>
	<<earnFeat "Home Cooking">>
<<elseif $gift is "valentines_chocolate" and $valentines>>
	<<earnFeat "Be My Valentine">>
	You hand Alex the box of chocolates. <<He>> smiles. "Valentine's chocolate!
	<<if $farm_stage gte 7>>
		Of course I'll be your Valentine."
	<<else>>
		You surprise me, but it's not unwelcome. I'll be your Valentine if you'll be mine."
	<</if>>
	<<gglove>><<npcincr Alex love 3>>
	<br><br>
	<<He>> opens the box, and pops one of the chocolates into <<his>> mouth. "Very nice," <<he>> says while chewing. "You've so many talents." <<He>> eats another, and another. Seems <<hes>> worked up quite the appetite for chocolate.
	<br><br>
	<<if $farm_stage gte 7 and $alex_countdown is undefined>>
		<<He>> puts the empty box aside, and smiles at you. "Do I owe you a kiss?"
		<br><br>

		<<link [[Kiss|Alex Gifts Valentines Kiss]]>><<npcincr Alex love 3>><</link>><<kissvirginitywarning>><<gglove>>
		<br>
		<<link [[Present your cheek|Alex Gifts Valentines Cheek]]>><<npcincr Alex love 1>><</link>>
		<br>
		<<link [[Say it's not necessary|Alex Gifts Valentines Not]]>><</link>>
		<br>
	<<else>>
		<<He>> puts the empty box aside, and smiles at you. "Don't tell my parents I ate them so fast. They were always on at me for that."
		<br><br>
		<<link [[Next|Farm Alex Bedroom]]>><<endevent>><</link>>
		<br>
	<</if>>
<<elseif setup.foodstuff[$gift].food.tags.includes("spicy")>>
	You place the <<recipe_name $gift>> in front of Alex. <<He>> licks <<his>> lips. "Smells spicy," <<he>> says, lifting <<his>> cutlery. "I hope it's really hot."
	<br><br>
	<<He>> tucks in, showing no sign of pain at first, but it's not long before tears start to stream. <<He>> doesn't stop eating though, until the dish is empty.
	<br><br>
	"Thanks," <<he>> says, wiping <<his>> cheeks with a tissue. "It's like you'd get at a restaurant, but more wholesome, somehow."<<glove>><<npcincr Alex love 1>>
	<br><br>
	<<link [[Next|Farm Alex Bedroom]]>><<endevent>><</link>>
	<br>
<<elseif setup.foodstuff[$gift].food.tags.includes("drink")>>
	You hand Alex the <<recipe_name $gift>>. <<He>> swirls it around. "Looks refreshing," <<he>> says. Then takes a sip. "Mmm." <<He>> takes a gulp. "That hits the spot."<<glove>><<npcincr Alex love 1>>
	<br><br>

	<<He>> finishes the rest of the drink in one go, and releases a satisfied sigh as <<he>> slams the empty vessel against <<his>> desk. "Thanks."
	<br><br>

	<<link [[Next|Farm Alex Bedroom]]>><<endevent>><</link>>
	<br>
<<else>>
	<<if !$per_npc.alexs_parent1>>
		<<generate2>>
		<<saveNPC 1 "alexs_parent1">>
	<<else>>
		<<loadNPC 1 "alexs_parent1">>
	<</if>>
	You hold out the <<recipe_name $gift>>. Alex whistles. "That looks delicious," <<he>> says. "All for me? Thank you."
	<br><br>
	<<He>> takes a bite. <<His>> enjoyment is clear at once. "You're a good cook," <<he>> says. "Better than <<person2>><<Mum>>." Another bite. "Don't tell <<him>> I said that."
	<br><br>
	<<person1>><<He>> puts down the plate. "Don't hesitate to feed me again should the idea strike you."<<glove>><<npcincr Alex love 1>>
	<br><br>
	<<link [[Next|Farm Alex Bedroom]]>><<endevent>><</link>>
	<br>
<</if>>

:: Alex Gifts Valentines Kiss
<<effects>>

You put your arms around Alex, and lean in. <<His>> kiss is deep, and lingering.
<<takeKissVirginity "Alex" "loveInterest">>
<br><br>

Alex pulls away, smilling. "That chocolate's a steal for a price so low," <<he>> says. "Not a price at all."
<br><br>

<<link [[Next|Farm Alex Bedroom]]>><<endevent>><</link>>
<br>

:: Alex Gifts Valentines Cheek
<<effects>>

Alex takes your meaning, puts an arm around you waist, and plants a kiss on your cheek.
<br><br>

"Thanks love," <<he>> says with another smile. "I wouldn't say no to more chocolate at any time of year."
<br><bR>

<<link [[Next|Farm Alex Bedroom]]>><<endevent>><</link>>
<br>

:: Alex Gifts Valentines Not
<<effects>>

"You wound me," Alex says, putting a hand over <<his>> heart and leaning back as if struck, but <<he>> doesn't stop smiling. "I'll find a way to earn your love. And more of your chocolate."
<br><br>

<<link [[Next|Farm Alex Bedroom]]>><<endevent>><</link>>
<br>

:: Alex Gifts Breakfast Tell
<<effects>>

<<if $speech_attitude is "meek">>
	"You're spilling some," you say. "I made it for you, not the carpet."
<<elseif $speech_attitude is "bratty">>
	"You eat like one of the pigs," you say.
<<else>>
	"I'd get in trouble eating so messily back in the orphanage," you say.
<</if>>
<br><br>

"Sorry," Alex says with <<his>> mouth full. "It's just too tasty." <<He>> cleans up the crumbs, and continues with a more measured pace.
<br><br>

<<link [[Next|Farm Alex Bedroom]]>><<endevent>><</link>>
<br>

:: Alex Gifts Breakfast Watch
<<effects>>
<<loadNPC 1 "alexs_parent2">>
You watch Alex devour the meal. <<He>> reclines in <<his>> chair when finished, <<his>> eyes closed, and a satisfied smile on <<his>> face. "Thanks," <<he>> says. "Even better than <<person2>><<ma>> used to make."<<person1>>
<br><br>

<<link [[Next|Farm Alex Bedroom]]>><<endevent>><</link>>
<br>

:: Alex Gifts Crumble Thank
<<effects>>

<<if $speech_attitude is "meek">>
	"Thank you," you say. "That means a lot."
<<elseif $speech_attitude is "bratty">>
	"Thanks for appreciating me," you say.
<<else>>
	"Thank you," you say.
<</if>>
<br><br>

"No problem," Alex says, losing some crumbs in the process. "I'm lucky to have someone like you."
<br><br>

<<He>> finishes the dessert, and stretches.
<br><br>

<<link [[Next|Farm Alex Bedroom]]>><<endevent>><</link>>
<br>

:: Alex Gifts Crumble Compliment
<<effects>>

<<if $speech_attitude is "meek">>
	"You work so hard on the farm," you say. "So I did my best."
<<elseif $speech_attitude is "bratty">>
	"I need to keep your energy up," you say. "You work so hard."
<<else>>
	"You work really hard on the farm," you say. "So it's only fair."
<</if>>
<br><br>

Alex smiles with pride. "Thanks," <<he>> says, dropping crumbs down <<his>> shirt. "You're very kind."
<br><br>

<<He>> finishes the crumble, and burps in satisfaction.
<br><br>

<<link [[Next|Farm Alex Bedroom]]>><<endevent>><</link>>
<br>

:: Alex Gifts Steak Water
<<effects>>

You fetch some water for Alex. <<He>> gulps it down. "Thanks, love," <<he>> says, before shovelling more steak into <<his>> mouth.
<br><br>

<<He>> leans back when finished, and pats <<his>> stomach. "You're a good chef."
<br><br>

<<link [[Next|Farm Alex Bedroom]]>><<endevent>><</link>>
<br>

:: Alex Gifts Steak Wait
<<effects>>

You wait for Alex to finish. At one point, <<he>> chokes on an eager piece of steak, but holds <<his>> hand up to decline your help, and manages to cough it up.
<br><br>

<<He>> inhales, sighs, and smiles. "You're a good chef."
<br><br>

<<link [[Next|Farm Alex Bedroom]]>><<endevent>><</link>>
<br>
